          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "предотвращать (predotvrashchát) is built from пред- \"before\", от- \"away\" and вращать \"to turn\", the Church Slavonic twin of native ворочать: to turn a danger away in advance. The -ра- and the щ are both Church Slavonic shapes."
            }
          ]
        },
